#: src/overview.md:18
msgid "The same journal in exchange algebra"
msgstr "同じ仕訳帳を交換代数で表す"

#: src/overview.md:20
msgid "Exchange algebra writes an entry as a sum of postings $a : e$, where $a$ is a nonnegative amount and $e$ is a base. Here a base is an account title in angle brackets. A plain base such as $\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$ records an increase (`Not`), and a hat base such as $\\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle}$ records a decrease (`Hat`). The four rows of Table 1 become:"
msgstr "交換代数では, 仕訳を項 (posting) $a : e$ の和で表します. $a$ は非負の金額, $e$ は基底です. ここでは, 山括弧で囲んだ勘定科目が基底に当たります. $\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$ のような通常の基底は増加 (`Not`) を, $\\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle}$ のような hat 基底は減少 (`Hat`) を記録します. 表 1 の 4 行は次のようになります:"

#: src/overview.md:22
msgid "$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x_1 &= 1000 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 1000 : \\langle \\text{Capital stock} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_2 &= 600 : \\langle \\text{Purchases} \\rangle + 600 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle} \\\\\\\\ x_3 &= 900 : \\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle + 900 : \\langle \\text{Sales} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_4 &= 500 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 500 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle} \\\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr "$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x_1 &= 1000 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 1000 : \\langle \\text{Capital stock} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_2 &= 600 : \\langle \\text{Purchases} \\rangle + 600 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle} \\\\\\\\ x_3 &= 900 : \\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle + 900 : \\langle \\text{Sales} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_4 &= 500 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 500 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle} \\\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/overview.md:31
msgid "The postings carry neither debit and credit labels nor minus signs. Each posting states which account changed and in which direction. The journal side follows from the account's division: an increase in an asset or expense is a debit, and an increase in a liability, equity, or revenue account is a credit. A decrease takes the opposite side. For example, the increase in capital stock in $x_1$ is a credit, and the decrease in cash in $x_2$ is also a credit. [Account classes and sides](algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides) gives the full rule, including contra accounts."
msgstr "項には借方や貸方のラベルも負号も付けません. 各項は, どの勘定がどちらの方向に変化したかを表します. 借方と貸方の別は勘定の区分から決まります. 資産と費用の増加は借方, 負債, 純資産, 収益の増加は貸方です. 減少の場合は反対側になります. 例えば, $x_1$ の資本金の増加も, $x_2$ の現金の減少も貸方です. 評価勘定を含む規則の全体は[勘定の区分と貸借](algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:33
msgid "The whole journal is the sum $x = x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4$ of eight postings. The sum keeps every posting: cash has $1000$ and $500$ on the plain base and $600$ on the hat base. Bar, written $\\bar{x}$, totals the two directions at each base and keeps the excess. For cash it leaves $900 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$, the cash balance."
msgstr "仕訳帳全体は, 8 個の項の和 $x = x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4$ です. 和はすべての項を保持します. 現金については, 通常の基底に $1000$ と $500$, hat 基底に $600$ が記録されます. $\\bar{x}$ と書く bar は, 各基底の両方向をそれぞれ合計し, 差額を残します. 現金では $900 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$ が残り, 現金残高を表します."

#: src/overview.md:35
msgid "Recover the debit and credit columns"
msgstr "借方列と貸方列を取り出す"

#: src/overview.md:37
msgid "The projection `decL` selects the debit postings of $x$ and `decR` selects the credit postings. `decL` returns cash 1,000, purchases 600, accounts receivable 900, and cash 500, which is the debit column of Table 1. `decR` returns the credit column. Both totals are 3,000, so `balance` returns `True`."
msgstr "射影 `decL` は $x$ の借方の項を, `decR` は貸方の項を選びます. `decL` が返すのは現金 1,000, 仕入 600, 売掛金 900, 現金 500 で, 表 1 の借方列に一致します. `decR` は貸方列を返します. 両方の合計が 3,000 なので, `balance` は `True` を返します."

